#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:1
msgid "Backend Extensions"
msgstr "后端扩展"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:3
msgid ""
"A backend extension is a trusted Python module that a deployment loads "
"into the gateway at startup. It can add an adapter kind, decide who may "
"use the Cloud Agent, or report provider quotas. For changes that need no "
"code, see [Distribution customization](distribution-customization.md)."
msgstr ""
"后端扩展是部署在启动时加载进网关的受信任 Python 模块。它可以新增一种 adapter kind，决定谁可以使用 Cloud "
"Agent，或者上报 provider 的额度。不需要写代码的改动见[发行版定制](distribution-customization.md)。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:8
msgid "Loading an extension"
msgstr "加载扩展"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:10
msgid ""
"List the module names, comma-separated, in `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` (empty by"
" default). Each module defines a synchronous `register()` that takes no "
"arguments. At startup, after loading `.env` and before building any "
"routes, the gateway imports each module once and calls `register()`. If "
"either fails, the gateway refuses to start; it never falls back to "
"another adapter."
msgstr ""
"在 `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 中列出模块名，用逗号分隔（默认为空）。每个模块定义一个不带参数的同步 "
"`register()`。启动时，网关在加载 `.env` 之后、构建任何路由之前，逐个导入模块一次并调用其 "
"`register()`。任何一步失败，网关都会拒绝启动，绝不会退而使用另一个 adapter。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:16
msgid ""
"An extension is trusted server code, not configuration. Make it "
"importable through the deployment, for example a read-only mount of its "
"overlay, and never derive module names from a request or let an admin "
"form choose them. Import all of its code at startup, and restart the "
"backend after changing it."
msgstr ""
"扩展是受信任的服务端代码，不是配置。请通过部署让它可以被导入，例如以只读方式挂载部署的 "
"overlay；绝不要根据请求推导模块名，也不要让管理表单来选择模块。在启动时导入它的全部代码，修改后重启后端。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:21
msgid ""
"To add an adapter kind, call "
"`serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, *, "
"override=False)` from `register()`. The factory receives the route's "
"configuration dictionary, before built-in provider defaults are applied, "
"and returns an adapter. A kind can be registered once, and becomes a "
"reserved provider label; replacing a built-in kind needs `override=True`."
" `register()` may also add entries to the shared runtime-setting and "
"provider metadata dictionaries, in place. [Deployment-local adapters"
"](provider-adapters.md#deployment-local-adapters) has a minimal factory "
"example."
msgstr ""
"要新增一种 adapter kind，请在 `register()` 中调用 "
"`serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, *, "
"override=False)`。factory 在内置 provider 默认值生效之前收到该路由的配置字典，并返回一个 adapter。每种 "
"kind 只能注册一次，注册后成为保留的 provider 标签；替换内置 kind 需要 "
"`override=True`。`register()` 还可以原地向共享的运行时设置项和 provider 元数据字典中添加条目。[部署本地的 "
"adapter](provider-adapters.md#deployment-local-adapters) 中有一个最小的 factory "
"示例。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:31
msgid "Cloud Agent access"
msgstr "云端 Agent 访问权限"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:33
msgid ""
"The deployment decides who may use or administer its Cloud Agent. An "
"extension registers one synchronous callback with "
"`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)`. The gateway "
"first checks that the user exists and is `active`, then calls the "
"callback with a read-only mapping holding only `user_id` and `role`. The "
"callback returns a `list[str]` or `tuple[str, ...]` of permissions: "
"`agent.use` to use the Agent, and `agent.admin`, valid only with "
"`agent.use`, to administer it. Anything else makes the result invalid. "
"Without a registered policy, every role is denied."
msgstr ""
"谁可以使用或管理 Cloud Agent 由部署决定。扩展用 "
"`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)` "
"注册一个同步回调。网关先确认用户存在且状态为 `active`，再用一个只读映射调用回调，其中只有 `user_id` 和 "
"`role`。回调返回一个由权限组成的 `list[str]` 或 `tuple[str, ...]`：`agent.use` 表示可以使用 "
"Agent，`agent.admin` 表示可以管理它，且只有与 `agent.use` "
"同时出现才有效。其他任何内容都会使结果无效。没有注册策略时，所有角色都被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:42
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The standalone Agent reads the decision from `GET "
"/internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access` with the "
"`GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` bearer token. The response holds only "
"`user_id`, `allowed` (true when `agent.use` is granted) and "
"`permissions`, in the order `agent.use`, `agent.admin`; a denial is HTTP "
"200 with `allowed: false`. The policy runs on every request, but the "
"account it sees may be up to 60 seconds old when it was changed outside "
"this gateway process."
msgstr ""
"独立部署的 Agent 用 `GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` 作为 bearer token，从 `GET "
"/internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access` 读取判定结果。响应只包含 "
"`user_id`、`allowed`（授予了 `agent.use` 时为 true）和 `permissions`，后者按 "
"`agent.use`、`agent.admin` 的顺序排列；拒绝时返回 HTTP 200 和 `allowed: "
"false`。策略在每个请求上都会执行，但如果账户是在本网关进程之外修改的，它看到的账户信息最多可能滞后 60 秒。"

