#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:118
msgid ""
"These settings turn off `.env` loading and user authentication, and use a"
" public admin token and JWT signing secret. Keep the listener on loopback"
" and never use them in a real deployment. Read the result the console "
"shows:"
msgstr ""
"这些设置关闭了 `.env` 加载和用户认证，并使用公开的管理员令牌和 JWT 签名密钥。请让监听地址保持在 loopback "
"上，绝不要在真实部署中使用它们。读取控制台显示的同一份结果："

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:127
msgid ""
"Send a few requests, and let the first five-second probe and snapshot "
"cycle finish:"
msgstr "发送几个请求，并等第一个五秒的探测与快照周期完成："

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:136
msgid ""
"The response names the fixture that answered. Requests go to the fallback"
" until the quota route has a usage snapshot and evidence for its cost "
"envelope. Chat requests, probes included, use up the mock quota. To "
"simulate exhaustion, restart the quota fixture with `--quota-limit 100 "
"--quota-used 100`; after the next snapshot, requests go to the fallback."
msgstr ""
"响应会写明是哪个模拟服务应答的。在额度路由同时拥有用量快照和成本包络的依据之前，请求都会走回退。聊天请求（包括主动探测）会消耗模拟额度。要模拟额度耗尽，用"
" `--quota-limit 100 --quota-used 100` 重启额度模拟服务；下一次快照之后，请求会转到回退。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:142
msgid ""
"To see the card in the console, configure the same extension and registry"
" on a local full-stack demo backend (see the [Quickstart](router-"
"tutorial.md)), open **Providers** and scroll to **Quotas**, below the "
"keys. Inside Compose, `127.0.0.1` is the backend container, not the host."
" Without results, the Quotas section links back here; the rest of the "
"Providers tab needs no quota source."
msgstr ""
"要在控制台中看到额度卡片，请在本地完整演示栈的后端上配置同一个扩展和注册表（见[快速上手](router-tutorial.md)），打开 "
"**Providers** 并向下滚动到密钥下方的 **Quotas**。在 Compose 中，`127.0.0.1` "
"指的是后端容器，而不是宿主机。没有结果时，Quotas 区域会链接回本节；Providers 标签页的其余部分不需要额度来源。"

#: ../developer/backend-extensions.md:148
msgid ""
"For your own integration, copy the extension and replace its query with a"
" data source you are authorized to use. Keep the result contract, give "
"every request a timeout, and keep credentials out of responses and logs."
msgstr "要做你自己的集成，请复制这个扩展，把其中的查询换成你有权使用的数据源。保持结果约定不变，为每个请求设置超时，并且不要让凭据出现在响应和日志中。"

